docs/admin/monitor-comply/zero-data-retention.md:# Zero data retention
docs/admin/monitor-comply/zero-data-retention.md:Zero data retention (ZDR) controls whether supported API inputs and outputs are retained after Mistral returns a response. Use this guide to understand what ZDR covers, what it excludes, and how to request it for your Organization.
docs/admin/monitor-comply/zero-data-retention.md:## What zero data retention covers {#what-zdr-covers}
docs/admin/monitor-comply/zero-data-retention.md:## What zero data retention does not cover {#what-zdr-does-not-cover}
docs/admin/monitor-comply/zero-data-retention.md:## Request zero data retention {#request-zdr}
docs/admin/monitor-comply/zero-data-retention.md:To request ZDR, contact support through the [ZDR Help Center article](https://help.mistral.ai/en/articles/347612-can-i-activate-zero-data-retention-zdr) or [contact Mistral support](https://help.mistral.ai/en/articles/347458-how-do-i-contact-support).
